<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH NOV PRELIM IND. OUTPUT UP 1.5 PCT YR/YR - CSU.</title>
<headline>CZECH NOV PRELIM IND. OUTPUT UP 1.5 PCT YR/YR - CSU.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech preliminary real industrial</p>
<p>output in November rose 1.5 percent, year-on-year, putting</p>
<p>output 7.4 percent higher for the January-November period, the</p>
<p>Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Monday.</p>
<p> INDUSTRIAL OUPUT	 NOV 96    OCT 96    NOV 95 JAN-NOV 96</p>
<p>  real pct chg yr/yr    +1.5	 +5.3     +13.1     +7.4</p>
<p> AVERAGE INDUST WAGES  NOV 96    OCT 96    NOV 95   JAN-NOV 96</p>
<p>  nominal chg yr/yr    +14.4	+18.2     +19.0    +17.2</p>
<p>Note. Wage results are taken from a survey of 210 firms with</p>
<p>100 or more employees. Production results also contain</p>
<p>estimates from firms with up to 100 workers, as well as</p>
<p>physical persons registered in the trades offices.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
